# Rendered by render-configs.sh from *.template files, and filled by
# decrypt-secrets.sh (secrets.env.local — decrypted at deploy time from
# the committed ciphertext in secrets/silo/*.sops.yaml, never itself
# committed) and by hand (.env.local — copy from local.env.example). The
# *.template / *.example files are the tracked source of truth; these are
# always regeneratable, never hand-edit them directly.
.env.local
*/secrets.env.local
*/config/*
!*/config/*.template
